    "summary": {
      "value": "Gain beneﬁts when you cast spells on a personal vehicle"
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Pilot</strong>.</p><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p>After you cast the <strong>first</strong> spell of your turn during a conflict, if you are driving your <strong>personal vehicle</strong>, you may choose one option (after the spell has been resolved):</p><ul><li><p>Choose one enabled <strong>module</strong> and <strong>disable</strong> it, then choose one disabled <strong>module</strong> and <strong>enable</strong> it.</p></li><li><p>The next spell you cast before the end of this scene that deals damage deals 5 extra damage.</p></li><li><p>The next spell you cast before the end of this scene that restores Hit Points to one or more creatures restores 10 additional Hit Points to each of those creatures.</p></li></ul><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>You Gain:</strong> @EFFECT[pfu-steel-witch-damage] or @EFFECT[pfu-steel-witch-recovery]</p>",
